---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { info } from "../../data/info";

const lastUpdatedDate = "October 21, 2026";

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy";
const metaDescription = `Read the ${info.name} Privacy Policy. We don't use accounts, ads, analytics or cookies; your puzzle progress stays in your browser.`;

const h2 = "mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink";
const h3 = "mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-ink";
const h4 = "font-semibold text-ink";
const body = "text-ink/80";
const list = "ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-ink/80";
const note = "rounded-md border border-accent/25 bg-accent/5 p-3";
const link = "text-accent hover:underline";
---

<LegalLayout title={pageTitle} description={metaDescription} lastUpdated={lastUpdatedDate}>
  <div>
    <p class={`${body} leading-relaxed`}>
      {info.name} ("we," "us," or "our") operates this website (the "Site"), which offers free daily
      puzzles. This Privacy Policy explains what information is involved when you use the Site, how
      it's used, and the choices you have. The short version: there are no accounts, ads, analytics or
      cookies of our own, and your puzzle progress stays on your device.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Information We Collect</h2>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class={h3}>1) Information Stored on Your Device</h3>
        <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>
          To make the puzzles work, the Site saves a small amount of information in your browser's
          local storage, such as:
        </p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li>Your progress and time on each day's puzzles</li>
          <li>Your light or dark mode choice</li>
          <li>Which puzzles you've already seen the "How to play" guide for</li>
        </ul>
        <div class={`mt-3 ${note}`}>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/80">
            <span class="font-semibold">Note:</span> This information never leaves your device and is
            never sent to us. Progress from past days is cleared automatically, and you can remove all
            of it at any time by clearing your browser's site data.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class={h3}>2) Information You Send Us</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you choose to include in your
          message.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class={h3}>3) Information Handled by Our Service Providers</h3>
        <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>
          Like any website, loading the Site involves services that receive basic technical information
          from your browser:
        </p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li>
            <span class="font-semibold">Cloudflare</span>, which hosts the Site, processes information such
            as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to deliver the Site, keep it secure
            and monitor its performance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="font-semibold">Google Fonts</span>, which supplies the Site's fonts, receives your
            IP address and browser information when the fonts load.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>We use information to:</p>
    <ul class={list}>
      <li>Run the puzzles and remember your progress on your device</li>
      <li>Reply to your emails</li>
      <li>Keep the Site working, secure and fast, and fix problems</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      We don't set cookies, and we don't use analytics, advertising or tracking tools. Local storage
      (described above) is used only to make the puzzles work. Our hosting provider may use strictly
      necessary cookies to protect the Site from abuse.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>How We Share Information</h2>
    <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>
      We do not sell your personal information. We may share information in limited circumstances:
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div>
        <h4 class={h4}>Service Providers:</h4>
        <p class={body}>
          The providers described above (Cloudflare for hosting and Google Fonts for fonts) process
          information on our behalf to run the Site.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class={h4}>Legal and Safety:</h4>
        <p class={body}>
          If required by law, or to protect our rights, safety, and property, or the rights, safety,
          and property of others.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class={h4}>Business Transfers:</h4>
        <p class={body}>
          If the Site is sold or transferred, information may be transferred as part of that
          transaction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Data Retention</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      Information in your browser's local storage stays on your device until it's cleared
      automatically or you clear it yourself. Emails are kept only as long as needed to respond to you
      or meet legal obligations. Information handled by our service providers is kept according to
      their own retention policies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Security</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site is served over a secure (HTTPS) connection, and we use reasonable measures to protect
      information. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute
      security.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Your Choices</h2>
    <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights such as:</p>
    <ul class={list}>
      <li>Requesting access to or deletion of personal information you sent us</li>
      <li>Requesting correction of inaccurate personal information</li>
      <li>Removing everything the Site stored on your device by clearing your browser's site data</li>
    </ul>
    <p class={`${body} mt-3`}>To make a request, contact us using the details below.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children. The Site doesn't ask anyone for personal information to play.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site links to external services, such as
      <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/" class={link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy Me a Coffee</a>
      for optional support. We do not control these sites. Once you leave the Site, any information you
      provide is governed by that service's own privacy policy and terms, not {info.name}'s.
    </p>
    <div class={`mt-3 ${note}`}>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink/80">
        <span class="font-semibold">Note:</span> You can review our providers' privacy policies at
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class={link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cloudflare.com/privacypolicy</a>
        and
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class={link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on this
      page and revise the "Last Updated" date above.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
